, Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "305037"} "Flyweight (≤52 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "305074"} "Bantamweight (≤56 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "305148"} "Lightweight (≤60 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "305185"} "Light-Welterweight (≤64 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "305222"} "Welterweight (≤69 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "305259"} "Middleweight (≤75 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "305296"} "Light-Heavyweight (≤81 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "305333"} "Heavyweight (≤91 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "305373"} "Flyweight (48-51 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "305393"} "Lightweight (57-60 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "305413"} "Middleweight (69-75 kilograms), Women"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "25564"} "1984"] "\n" [:option {:value "26067"} "1988"] "\n" [:option {:value "26496"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "26940"} "1996"] "\n" [:option {:value "27356"} "2000"] "\n" [:option {:value "27718"} "2004"] "\n" [:option {:value "258552"} "2008"] "\n" [:option {:value "356633"} "2016"] "\n" [:option {:value "19005859"} "2020"] "\n" [:option {:value "2001172"} "2024"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/155"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Super-Heavyweight (&gt;91 kilograms), Men" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "1 – 12 August 2012"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/861"} "ExCeL, Newham, London"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/305353"} "16 from 16 countries"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Format"] [:td {:colspan "2"} "Single elimination tournament."]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "Traditionally the “Blue Riband” event of the boxing tournament, the super-heavyweight division was perhaps even more eagerly anticipated than usual due to the depth of talent in the division. Defending champion " [:a {:href "/athletes/106357"} "Roberto Cammarelle"] " was joined in London by world champion " [:a {:href "/athletes/121606"} "Məhəmmədrəsul Məcidov"] " of Azerbaijan, Beijing finalist " [:a {:href "/athletes/113061"} "Zhang Zhilei"] " of China and the rising young British talent " [:a {:href "/athletes/122655"} "Anthony Joshua"] "."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Though cheered on fanatically by the home support Joshua was nearly eliminated in his first fight and was fortunate to be given the decision over Cuban " [:a {:href "/athletes/123515"} "Erislandy Savón"] ", nephew of the legendary " [:a {:href "/athletes/1681"} "Félix Savón"] ". Joshua improved on this display in his next fights and reached the final with a victory over Russia’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/126827"} "Ivan Dychko"] " while in the other semi-final Cammarelle won a close but deserved decision over Məcidov. The final bout between the Italian and the Briton, whilst not a classic, turned into a nail-biter. For the first two rounds the more streetwise and experienced Cammarelle kept the young British fighter at bay but a desperate attack in the third brought Joshua back into contention. Neutral observers were a little surprised when the score was announced as a tie and the Italian contingent were certainly unhappy when Joshua was awarded the fight on countback."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Joshua’s victory denied Cammarelle the honour of becoming the first man to defend an Olympic title in the heaviest weight category since " [:a {:href "/athletes/1683"} "Teófilo Stevenson"] "."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"